For an effective dance you should be an a small non-teleport level,
like Sokoban, and Sokoban may be comparably deep already; entry on
dlvl 6-10. That means that you must be able to survive until then.
But if you can survive that deep you probably don't need those few
HPs any more to survive. And always remember that you are very very
vulnerable if you're nurse-dancing without armor; a swarm of soldier
ants, or a horde of poisoned missile shooting orcs, or a mumak, may
all kill you quite fast; engraving the E-word helps only in some of
the dangerous cases.

> TJR - are the dragons level dependent on MY level or just the DL I
